    {
      "component_id": "c_012",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Period Tracker, the easiest way to track your periods! Must have Android 2.1 and higher. Period Tracker is SIMPLE and CUTE. * Press a button at the start of your period every month. Period Tracker logs your dates and calculates the average of your past 3 months' manstrual cycles to predict the start date of your next period. * View your current and future period dates, ovulation and fertile days, your moods and your symptoms in a simple month-view calendar. * Decorate your Android with an icon that looks great on your home screen and that's discreet. It reads simply \"P Tracker.\" Period Tracker is FILLED WITH FEATURES. * Take daily notes of menstrual moods and symptoms * See the number of days until your next period or the number of days late. * Know when you're fertile with cute icons show on your homescreen during your predicted ovulation and eight day fertile window. keywords: menstruation, pregnancy, woman, mood, menstruating, ferility",
